 ence: May 23-26\, 2027\nLocation: Seoul\, South Korea\nVenue: COEX Magok\n
 \nAll dates:\n  Digest submission: 25 Oct 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n 
  Acceptance notification: 15 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final ma
 nuscript submission: 12 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Early registr
 ation: 31 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers states 
 no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it could plausibly m
 ean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than after
  it.\n\nHeld as ICPE 2027-ECCE Asia\, the 12th International Conference on
  Power Electronics.\n\nCall for papers: https://www.icpe-conf.org/\nDetail
 s: https://langestefan.github.io/powersystem-deadlines/conference/ecce-asi
 a27
LOCATION:Seoul\, South Korea
